  "steps": [
    "Sources are pulled (satellite scenes, open data) or received (partner plots and loan books, checked first).",
    "Batch jobs clip every source to each site and save one observation per indicator and period.",
    "A score request is served from the stored observations by the signal engine, behind a cache.",
    "Notes and explanations call models only through Jev, which routes, checks and logs every call.",
    "Clients reach everything through the API gateway: web app, MCP server, webhooks and exports."
  ]
